  "faqTitle": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "faqIsSafeQuestion": "Is this service safe?",
  "faqIsSafeAnswer": "TrackFollows does not ask for your Instagram password or sign in to your account. Selected files are analyzed on your device. Usage diagnostics and advertising services have separate data practices, described in the Privacy Policy.",
  "faqDownloadTimeQuestion": "How long does it take to download my data?",
  "faqDownloadTimeAnswer": "Instagram prepares the export. Preparation time varies; check its notification or export screen and download the ZIP when it is ready.",
  "faqWhatIsUnfollowerQuestion": "What exactly is an unfollower?",
  "faqWhatIsUnfollowerAnswer": "These accounts appear in your following list but not your follower list in the files you provide. They may include accounts that never followed you. A single export cannot establish whether someone previously followed you or when they unfollowed.",
  "faqThreadsQuestion": "Can I check my Threads unfollowers too?",
  "faqThreadsAnswer": "Yes. If the ZIP you downloaded from Instagram includes your Threads followers and following lists, you get a separate Threads result alongside your Instagram result. Switch between Instagram and Threads at the top of the results. Threads followers are a separate list from your Instagram followers.",
  "faqIsFreeQuestion": "Does it cost anything to use this service?",
  "faqIsFreeAnswer": "No, this service is completely free. You can use all features at no cost.",
  "faqIncorrectListQuestion": "The unfollower list appears different from what I expected. Why?",
  "faqIncorrectListAnswer": "Results reflect the lists in your export and may differ from Instagram today. Export timing, the selected date range, and deleted or deactivated accounts may affect the lists and counts.\n\nSelect All time when exporting and check that all follower and following files are included. A new export still cannot guarantee a match with current account status.",
  "faqFileSelectErrorQuestion": "I can't select the ZIP file",
  "faqFileSelectErrorAnswer": "When opening links from messaging apps like KakaoTalk, the file selection feature may not work properly. In this case, try accessing the site directly through browsers like Chrome or Samsung Internet to select the file. Usually, you can select files normally when accessing directly through a browser",
  "faqDataSecurityQuestion": "Data Security & Privacy",
  "faqDataSecurityAnswer": "Your original Instagram files, account names and follower lists are not sent to a server for analysis. To compare with your last analysis, the follower and following usernames are saved only on this device (browser or app), and you can delete them anytime with 'Delete history' on the results screen. See the Privacy Policy for information about usage diagnostics and advertising services."
